[4.218000, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ⠴ Cogitating… (2s · esc to interrupt)\u001b[0m"]
[4.282000, "o", "\r\u001b[2K"]
[4.282000, "o", "  Because it has one thread. While the command runs, it waits —\n"]
[4.328000, "o", "  thirty seconds of build is thirty seconds of nothing.\n"]
[4.373000, "o", "  jbx wraps every command the agent runs and lets go of the ones\n"]
[4.419000, "o", "  that turn out to be long. The cut is 30s by default; it is set\n"]
[4.464000, "o", "  to 10s here so this recording stays watchable.\n"]
[4.511000, "o", "\u001b[2m✻ Cogitated for 2s · done 18:46\u001b[0m\n"]
[4.515000, "o", "\n"]
